  "method": {
    "strategy": "First author notebook checks each alt short against its 2,000 USDT research target and rebalances a BTC long to their total. Trade orders use the historical hourly prices and a 20 USDT threshold. These are the author’s notebook settings. Archived live JS has a 50 USDT default and exchange-dependent execution.",
